DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
45456::$$$message_0425_0000_0000$$$::"Well there, King of Heroes. Fancy running into you here."::
45457::$$$message_0425_0000_0001$$$::"Hmph. I see that you're strolling around as usual, engaging in worthless pursuits while spouting drivel about conquest, Rider."::
45458::$$$message_0425_0000_0002$$$::"Ah-ha, I take it you're here on a pilgrimage to the Holy Grail bath, too?"::
45459::$$$message_0425_0000_0003$$$::"Spare me your mockery, mongrel. The people may seek out the king, but I need not seek anything on my own."::
45460::$$$message_0425_0000_0004$$$::"Uhhh..."::
45461::$$$message_0425_0000_0005$$$::"Don't respond, my master. It never ends well when you interrupt those two."::
45462::$$$message_0425_0000_0006$$$::"Hmm? You don't want to go to the onsen? You're not interested, when you came all this way?"::
45463::$$$message_0425_0000_0007$$$::"Of course not. I have tasted all the delights of this earth. Why would I be so fixated on taking a bath?"::
45464::$$$message_0425_0000_0008$$$::"Baths these days are nothing to sneeze at, you know."::
45465::$$$message_0425_0000_0009$$$::"It's got other amenities besides the open-air bath. I hear the stone sauna and jacuzzi are quite well-regarded."::
45466::$$$message_0425_0000_0010$$$::"Those don't have anything to do with onsen, though."::
45467::$$$message_0425_0000_0011$$$::"Why don't we both engage in a new bathing experience?[wvl][hffgchg2 chara=ライダー4th face=喜 pos=left time=300][hfwww layer=0] Personally, I'm quite curious about the water slides."::
45468::$$$message_0425_0000_0012$$$::"How dull. There was no shortage of such leisures in Uruk."::
45469::$$$message_0425_0000_0013$$$::"You don't say? You even had electric baths? And doctorfish therapy?"::
45470::$$$message_0425_0000_0014$$$::"Who do you take me for, mongrel!? [wvl canskip=false time=200][hffgchg2 chara=ギル4th face=怒3 pos=right time=300][hfwww layer=1]Each and every one of those things originated from my palace! I'm sure they're nothing special!"::
45471::$$$message_0425_0000_0015$$$::"What are you spacing out for, Tokiomi!? Kirei! Clear this vagrant from my path!"::
45472::$$$message_0425_0000_0016$$$::".[wait canskip=false time=20].[wait canskip=false time=20].[wait canskip=false time=20].[wait canskip=false time=20].[wait canskip=false time=20]."::
45473::$$$message_0425_0000_0017$$$::"Master, it would be neither wise nor elegant to remark right now."=��'